    <h1>Understanding the <span class="accent">Dark Web Economy</span><br>— Safe Edition</h1>
    <p class="lede">A five-part briefing for cybersecurity interns working remotely. Every
      step uses public, legal, filtered sources — the goal is to learn how to <strong>detect and disrupt</strong> this
      economy, not participate in it.</p>
